  The reel_script states the event took place 'திருப்பூர் மாவட்டம்' (Tiruppur district), which is not stated in the article.
  The slides_spec line 'அடித்தட்டு பணியாளர்களை ஊக்கப்படுத்த முயற்சி' and the caption's 'சிறப்புப் பரிசுகள்' describe the gifts as 'special' (சிறப்பு), which the article does not state; the article only says 'பரிசுகள்'.
  The caption says the 25 people were 'மேடையேற்றப்பட்டனர்' (were brought onto the stage), while the article says only that gifts were given and workers were honored on stage; the count of 25 is stated as 'பல்லடம் ... 25க்கும் மேற்பட்டோர்', consistent, so this is minor.
