  The reel_script and caption omit the hosting ward/ministry details? No — the key issue: the reel_script says the Tirupur Municipal Corporation 'conducted' the race, which matches the article, but the caption says the race was held 'by Tirupur Municipal Corporation' — consistent; however the caption's English line 'Anna cycle race in Tirupur, minister flags off | Tirupur news' is an untranslated English addition not in the article.
  The reel_script states the Deputy Mayor and District Sports Officer attended, but omits the district collector's role in presiding as an important fact; the reel_script says the collector presided, so this is covered.
  The reel_script's distance sentences ('13 வயதுக்குட்பட்ட மாணவர்களுக்கு 15 கிலோமீட்டர் மாணவிகளுக்கு 10 கிலோமீட்டர் தூரம்...') are run-on fragments that mix several facts without clear grammatical structure in Tamil.
